count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YtrFK3RwYNFSrRD8Yb84_Q","review_id":"-3JlnQNd20G24HLp3OH7-A","date":"2015-08-01T17:42:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9339432716369629,"text_excerpt":"I used to live a block away from Carrollton Station and it quickly became my favorite neighborhood bar. Great bartenders who are quick to serve you, remember who the hell you are, and are fun and friendly. I've been to several bars where I could be considered a \"regular\" and consistently get curt, bad service from someone who very obviously doesn't want me there. Carrollton Station is a breath of fresh air. The kitchen is open again and slinging some really good (and cheap) food, which is awesome. Wednesday nights are always the main draw for me, as it's open mic comedy night. The hosts of the show keep the train on the tracks against impossible odds as upward of 40 people sign up to be f..."},{"business_id":"YtrFK3RwYNFSrRD8Yb84_Q","review_id":"k5JzzblxZCa7OXktH4Q53w","date":"2021-05-01T19:59:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9249035120010376,"text_excerpt":"Great neighborhood bar with a solid beer selection. Their food is perfect pub food, I highly recommend the Frito pie. There's a chill resident cat that roams the back deck area as well. If covid ever relaxes and they can get back to having live music, it's a great small venue that with the right band (Debauche) the building literally shakes."},{"business_id":"YtrFK3RwYNFSrRD8Yb84_Q","review_id":"ba_Aj5rdgANZAKFL_pDeag","date":"2010-11-05T04:51:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9240658283233643,"text_excerpt":"This used to be my neighborhood bar when I lived on Hickory Street, thus I have fond memories of Carrollton Station. It's an excellent music venue, similar to Maple Leaf with fewer sweaty dancing people, as the shows tend to be more chill and rockabilly oriented than Papa Grows Funk-ish. They do an open mic comedy night every Wednesday, I believe, which is funny the first time you see it, and still fun after that because you get to know the comedians who're on the lineup every week. My only minor complaint is that they occasionally charge a cover, which is annoying pretty much across the board. I definitely want to support local talent, but I'd rather do so in the form of tips and drink s..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YtrFK3RwYNFSrRD8Yb84_Q","photo_id":"QrVXgL_Nr8yF8TDyf8PgCg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/QrVXgL_Nr8yF8TDyf8PgCg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9393901824951172},{"business_id":"YtrFK3RwYNFSrRD8Yb84_Q","photo_id":"_blx7LuRzxwolfJD4cvcwg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_blx7LuRzxwolfJD4cvcwg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8785583972930908},{"business_id":"YtrFK3RwYNFSrRD8Yb84_Q","photo_id":"7mAzUPErEE4gc8WNqpxa4A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7mAzUPErEE4gc8WNqpxa4A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.850042462348938},{"business_id":"YtrFK3RwYNFSrRD8Yb84_Q","photo_id":"xDabPAR5ENmVw1CVj8wqvA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xDabPAR5ENmVw1CVj8wqvA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8113476634025574}]},"notebook_case":null}
